There will be cases where segments will themselves have prefixes and suffixes, which is why we're setting the value separately.

Do you see this as an improvement?
```rust
const NODE_CHAR: &str = "⬢";
let module_color = Color::Green.bold();

let mut module = Module::new("node");
module.set_style(module_color);

let formatted_version = node_version.trim();
module.new_segment("symbol").set_value(NODE_CHAR);
module.new_segment("version").set_value(formatted_version);

Some(module)
```

